      "id": "claim_b1c82528fde74c928df83dde56352ec0",
      "statement": "The CLI is a single Click command in files_to_prompt/cli.py, exposed as the files-to-prompt console script via pyproject.toml and via python -m files_to_prompt through the __main__ module.",
